<mxfile host="app.diagrams.net"><diagram id="p_02_core_map_and_observers" name="02-core-map-and-observers"><mxGraphModel dx="800" dy="600" grid="0" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1480" pageHeight="887" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0" /><mxCell id="1" parent="0" /><mxCell id="title" value="One reserved core was saturated by three equal tenants, one of them our probe: moving the probe to a pool core freed the interaction service but cost the camera frames, so no placement is free on this layout" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=middle;align=left;fontSize=20;spacing=6;fontStyle=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="12" width="1440" height="60" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="gpool" value="" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=top;align=left;fontSize=11;spacing=6;fillColor=#f4f8fd;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="84" width="708" height="262" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="gpool_t" value="&lt;b&gt;POOL: 8 shared cores&lt;/b&gt; [pool_cores, illustrative], shared by most services under CFS (the camera, the object detector, audio input ...); attribution to one pool core is approximate" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=top;align=left;fontSize=11;spacing=6;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="90" width="690" height="40" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="giso" value="" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=top;align=left;fontSize=11;spacing=6;fillColor=#fafafa;strokeColor=#666666;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="750" y="84" width="700" height="262" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="giso_t" value="&lt;b&gt;RESERVED: 4 cores&lt;/b&gt; [reserved_cores, illustrative], removed from the general scheduler (isolcpus), services pinned by container cpuset. Board: an Orin-class board, 12 cores in all [board_cores, illustrative]" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=top;align=left;fontSize=11;spacing=6;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="760" y="90" width="680" height="40" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="pcore0" value="&lt;b&gt;pool core&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;fontSize=10;spacing=6;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="44" y="148" width="78" height="62" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="pcore1" value="&lt;b&gt;pool core&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;fontSize=10;spacing=6;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="130" y="148" width="78" height="62" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="pcore2" value="&lt;b&gt;pool core&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;fontSize=10;spacing=6;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="216" y="148" width="78" height="62" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="pcore3" value="&lt;b&gt;pool core&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;fontSize=10;spacing=6;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="302" y="148" width="78" height="62" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="pcore4" value="&lt;b&gt;pool core&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;fontSize=10;spacing=6;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="388" y="148" width="78" height="62" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="pcore5" value="&lt;b&gt;pool core&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;fontSize=10;spacing=6;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="474" y="148" width="78" height="62" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="pcore6" value="&lt;b&gt;pool core&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;fontSize=10;spacing=6;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="560" y="148" width="78" height="62" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="pcore7" value="&lt;b&gt;pool core&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;probe moved here" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;fontSize=10;spacing=6;dashed=1;dashPattern=5 3;fillColor=#ffd59e;strokeColor=#c47a00;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="646" y="148" width="78" height="62" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="poolstat" value="&lt;b&gt;Full stack, pool as a whole&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;busy 0.8 of the pool [pool_busy_frac_full, illustrative]&lt;br/&gt;run-queue wait 2 s per busy s [pool_wait_per_busy_full, illustrative] (camera-only row: 0.05 [pool_wait_per_busy_camera_only, illustrative])&lt;br/&gt;-&amp;gt; a one-thread worker's CPU-second takes about 3 s of wall time (my estimate from `pool_wait_per_busy_full`: 1 + 2; summed wait is not latency for parallel threads)" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=top;align=left;fontSize=10;spacing=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="44" y="218" width="680" height="96" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="rA" value="&lt;b&gt;reserved core A&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;middleware router (on every message path)&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;probe arm planned, &lt;b&gt;not run&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=top;align=center;fontSize=10;spacing=6;fillColor=#f0f0f0;strokeColor=#666666;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="762" y="148" width="130" height="150" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="rB" value="&lt;b&gt;reserved core B, full stack: saturated&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;three groups, equal CFS shares = &lt;b&gt;caps, not demands&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=top;align=center;fontSize=10;spacing=6;fillColor=#fff3f0;strokeColor=#b85450;strokeWidth=2.5;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="902" y="148" width="270" height="150" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="iaB" value="&lt;b&gt;interaction service&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;0.33 cores" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;fontSize=10;spacing=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#666666;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="910" y="196" width="82" height="64" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="wbcB" value="&lt;b&gt;a controller service&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;0.33 cores" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;fontSize=10;spacing=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#666666;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="996" y="196" width="82" height="64" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="probeB" value="&lt;b&gt;measurement probe&lt;/b&gt; (ours)&lt;br/&gt;0.33 cores" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;fontSize=10;spacing=6;fillColor=#ffd59e;strokeColor=#c47a00;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1082" y="196" width="82" height="64" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="cBcap" value="[saturated_core_equal_share, illustrative] each" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=top;align=left;fontSize=9;spacing=6;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#555555;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="910" y="264" width="256" height="30" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="rC" value="&lt;b&gt;reserved core C&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;the motor-control services (their own threads already queue)&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;never observers&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=top;align=center;fontSize=10;spacing=6;fillColor=#f0f0f0;strokeColor=#333333;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1182" y="148" width="126" height="150" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="rD" value="&lt;b&gt;reserved core D&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;the motor-control services' fast real-time bus loop&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;never observers&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=top;align=center;fontSize=10;spacing=6;fillColor=#f0f0f0;strokeColor=#333333;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1318" y="148" width="126" height="150" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="cluster" value="reserved cores A, C and D share the motor-control services' CPU cluster (shared cluster L3; page 04). Some late loops already on cores C-D." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;fontSize=10;spacing=6;dashed=1;dashPattern=4 3;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#333333;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="762" y="306" width="682" height="30" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="movelbl" value="probe move: reserved core B -&amp;gt; a pool core" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;fontSize=10;spacing=6;fontStyle=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#c47a00;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="905" y="120" width="260" height="17" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="th0" value="Quantity" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;fontSize=11;spacing=6;fontStyle=1;fillColor=#e6e6e6;strokeColor=#888888;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="368" width="266" height="40" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="th1" value="Probe on reserved core B&lt;br/&gt;(the service's core)" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;fontSize=11;spacing=6;fontStyle=1;fillColor=#e6e6e6;strokeColor=#888888;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="300" y="368" width="256" height="40" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="th2" value="Probe on a pool core&lt;br/&gt;(moved)" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;fontSize=11;spacing=6;fontStyle=1;fillColor=#e6e6e6;strokeColor=#888888;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="560" y="368" width="226" height="40" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="th3" value="Alone" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;fontSize=11;spacing=6;fontStyle=1;fillColor=#e6e6e6;strokeColor=#888888;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="790" y="368" width="120" height="40" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="q0" value="&lt;b&gt;Interaction service, request accepted p50 [interaction_accepted_ms, illustrative]&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=middle;align=left;fontSize=10;spacing=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#888888;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="412" width="266" height="46" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="a0" value="40 ms" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;fontSize=11;spacing=6;fillColor=#fff3f0;strokeColor=#b85450;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="300" y="412" width="256" height="46" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="b0" value="5 ms" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;fontSize=11;spacing=6;fillColor=#f1f8ee;strokeColor=#5f9e4f;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="560" y="412" width="226" height="46" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c0" value="2 ms" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;fontSize=11;spacing=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#888888;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="790" y="412" width="120" height="46" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="q1" value="&lt;b&gt;Reserved core B&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=middle;align=left;fontSize=10;spacing=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#888888;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="462" width="266" height="46" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="a1" value="saturated" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;fontSize=11;spacing=6;fillColor=#fff3f0;strokeColor=#b85450;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="300" y="462" width="256" height="46" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="b1" value="no longer saturated" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;fontSize=11;spacing=6;fillColor=#f1f8ee;strokeColor=#5f9e4f;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="560" y="462" width="226" height="46" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c1" value="—" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;fontSize=11;spacing=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#888888;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="790" y="462" width="120" height="46" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="q2" value="&lt;b&gt;Interaction service's main thread, run-queue wait&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=middle;align=left;fontSize=10;spacing=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#888888;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="512" width="266" height="46" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="a2" value="high" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;fontSize=11;spacing=6;fillColor=#fff3f0;strokeColor=#b85450;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="300" y="512" width="256" height="46" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="b2" value="much lower" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;fontSize=11;spacing=6;fillColor=#f1f8ee;strokeColor=#5f9e4f;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="560" y="512" width="226" height="46" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c2" value="—" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;fontSize=11;spacing=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#888888;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="790" y="512" width="120" height="46" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="q3" value="&lt;b&gt;Interaction service CPU&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=middle;align=left;fontSize=10;spacing=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#888888;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="562" width="266" height="46" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="a3" value="0.33 cores (a cap)" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;fontSize=11;spacing=6;fillColor=#fff3f0;strokeColor=#b85450;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="300" y="562" width="256" height="46" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="b3" value="more than its full-stack share" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;fontSize=11;spacing=6;fillColor=#f1f8ee;strokeColor=#5f9e4f;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="560" y="562" width="226" height="46" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c3" value="—" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;fontSize=11;spacing=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#888888;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="790" y="562" width="120" height="46" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="q4" value="&lt;b&gt;Probe receive delay p50 / p99 [probe_receive_delay_ms, illustrative]&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=middle;align=left;fontSize=10;spacing=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#888888;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="612" width="266" height="46" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="a4" value="10 / 30 ms" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;fontSize=11;spacing=6;fillColor=#fff3f0;strokeColor=#b85450;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="300" y="612" width="256" height="46" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="b4" value="p50 falls, p99 stays high" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;fontSize=11;spacing=6;fillColor=#f1f8ee;strokeColor=#5f9e4f;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="560" y="612" width="226" height="46" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c4" value="—" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;fontSize=11;spacing=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#888888;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="790" y="612" width="120" height="46" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="q5" value="&lt;b&gt;Probe CPU [probe_cores_wanted, illustrative]&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=middle;align=left;fontSize=10;spacing=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#888888;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="662" width="266" height="46" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="a5" value="0.33 cores (a cap)" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;fontSize=11;spacing=6;fillColor=#fff3f0;strokeColor=#b85450;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="300" y="662" width="256" height="46" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="b5" value="wants about 0.5 cores, still waits" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;fontSize=11;spacing=6;dashed=1;dashPattern=5 3;fillColor=#ffd59e;strokeColor=#c47a00;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="560" y="662" width="226" height="46" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c5" value="—" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;fontSize=11;spacing=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#888888;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="790" y="662" width="120" height="46" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="q6" value="&lt;b&gt;Depth camera service, rate [probe_on_pool_camera_cost_hz, illustrative]&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=middle;align=left;fontSize=10;spacing=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#888888;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="712" width="266" height="46" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="a6" value="reference" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;fontSize=11;spacing=6;fillColor=#fff3f0;strokeColor=#b85450;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="300" y="712" width="256" height="46" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="b6" value="loses about 2 Hz" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;fontSize=11;spacing=6;dashed=1;dashPattern=5 3;fillColor=#ffd59e;strokeColor=#c47a00;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="560" y="712" width="226" height="46" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c6" value="—" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;fontSize=11;spacing=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#888888;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="790" y="712" width="120" height="46" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="verdict" value="&lt;b&gt;The interaction service's full-stack latency was an observer effect.&lt;/b&gt; About 90 % of the excess over alone came from the bench (my estimate from `interaction_accepted_ms`: (40 − 5) ÷ (40 − 2) ≈ 0.92). The service waited for its core behind our probe. The instrument (the request driver) did not wait, so the full-stack value was measured correctly; it was caused by us.&lt;br/&gt;Pre-registered: core no longer saturated, met; p50 near alone, met; refutation rule not met." style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=top;align=left;fontSize=11;spacing=6;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="930" y="368" width="520" height="126" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="nofree" value="&lt;b&gt;No placement is free on this layout&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;reserved core B -&amp;gt; starves the interaction service (left column)&lt;br/&gt;a pool core -&amp;gt; the camera loses frames (amber cells)&lt;br/&gt;reserved cores C-D -&amp;gt; would compete with the motor loop at every wake-up (reasoning, not measured)&lt;br/&gt;reserved core A -&amp;gt; middleware router + the motor cluster; not tested&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;Real fix: a lighter probe&lt;/b&gt; (not measured)." style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=top;align=left;fontSize=11;spacing=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#333333;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="930" y="504" width="520" height="124" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="base" value="&lt;b&gt;New full-stack baseline, both bench fixes&lt;/b&gt; (probe on a pool core + the dialogue engine's log filter, note A4): interaction service p50 5 ms [interaction_accepted_ms: probe_moved]; transcript p50 640 ms [transcript_latency_ms: full_filtered, illustrative]; the camera pays about 2 Hz for the observers on the pool." style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=middle;align=left;fontSize=11;spacing=6;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#5f9e4f;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="930" y="638" width="520" height="80" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="legend" value="&lt;b&gt;Legend&lt;/b&gt;  blue = pool core; grey = reserved core (thick dark border = motor-control services, never observers); amber dashed = our observers and what moving them costs; red-bordered column = probe on the service's core; green cells = what the move fixed.&lt;br/&gt;Equal shares on a saturated core are what CFS gives groups that all want more: &lt;b&gt;caps, not demands&lt;/b&gt; (the interaction service used more once its core had room). Every full-stack probe latency carries the probe's own receive delay, so it is an upper bound. Core letters A-D are labels, not core numbers." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=top;align=left;fontSize=10;spacing=6;fillColor=#f7f7f7;strokeColor=#bbbbbb;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="776" width="640" height="95" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="src" value="&lt;b&gt;Sources.&lt;/b&gt; Numbers loaded from ../constants.json by spec02.py; key in brackets. Note A1 (pool, reserved cores, equal shares); note A5 (probe placement, new baseline, the untested core). Two windows per arm. Background on the observer effect: ../../robot-workload-benchmarking/notes/B4 and C7.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;Illustrative&lt;/b&gt; (round teaching numbers that keep the shape of a finding; not measurements): pool_cores, reserved_cores, board_cores, pool_busy_frac_full, pool_wait_per_busy_full, pool_wait_per_busy_camera_only, saturated_core_equal_share, interaction_accepted_ms, probe_receive_delay_ms, probe_cores_wanted, probe_on_pool_camera_cost_hz, transcript_latency_ms." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=top;align=left;fontSize=9;spacing=6;fillColor=#fff8dc;strokeColor=#d6b656;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="680" y="776" width="770" height="77" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e0" value="" style="endArrow=classic;html=1;fontSize=10;dashed=1;dashPattern=7 4;exitX=1;exitY=0.3;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;strokeColor=#c47a00;strokeWidth=2.5;" edge="1" parent="1" source="probeB" target="pcore7"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="1177" y="215" /><mxPoint x="1177" y="139" /><mxPoint x="685.0" y="139" /></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>